<title>USA: Fed refrains from open market operations.</title>
<headline>Fed refrains from open market operations.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>As expected, the Federal Reserve refrained from open market operations on Friday, dealers said.</p>
<p>At 1130 EDT/1530 GMT, the normal time for Fed operations, the federal funds rate stood at 5-1/8 percent, below the Fed's 5-1/4 percent target.</p>
<p>-- N.A. Treasury Desk 212-859-1673</p>
</text>
